STYLE="16-bit retro pixel art game background, 16:9, crisp chunky pixels on a coarse 320x180 grid, limited warm palette, dark outlines, matching the art style, lighting and palette of the reference image (a cozy after-hours backroom casino behind a nail supply shop: warm wood, brass lamps with warm pools of light, shelves of nail polish bottles, cardboard boxes, potted plants, dim moody shadows). No characters, no people, no animals, no text, no letters, no logos, no UI."
